nguage":"en-US","overview":"No one expects much from Christy Brown, a boy with cerebral palsy born into a working-class Irish family. Though Christy is a spastic quadriplegic and essentially paralyzed, a miraculous event occurs when, at the age of 5, he demonstrates control of his left foot by using chalk to scrawl a word on the floor. With the help of his steely mother — and no shortage of grit and determination — Christy overcomes his infirmity to become a painter, poet and author.","tagline":"A film about life, laughter, and the occasional miracle."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AuuBwtxenWgL5oVw0z488usClEu.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zjKg04EquTcnVZUfjHboXnXzjcF.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":10161,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AuuBwtxenWgL5oVw0z488usClEu.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AuuBwtxenWgL5oVw0z488usClEu.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AuuBwtxenWgL5oVw0z488usClEu.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AuuBwtxenWgL5oVw0z488usClEu.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a2eWkVUvyMY8vjg7CcTx4aNJBkK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a2eWkVUvyMY8vjg7CcTx4aNJBkK.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/GRAAl0bMQFoFIjV3aunc5jsM5u.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/GRAAl0bMQFoFIjV3aunc5jsM5u.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/GRAAl0bMQFoFIjV3aunc5jsM5u.jpg","previe